BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:R.L. Stine’s Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the Auditorium
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T150000
UID:bat-202611151300-r-l-stine-s-goosebumps-the-musical-phant@bloomingtona
 rts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Get ready for a frightfully fun adventure with Goosebumps T
 he Musical\, based on the wildly popular books by R. L. Stine! When Brooke
  and Zeke are cast in their school’s spooky new play\, The Phantom\, the
 y start to wonder if the show is actually cursed. As strange messages appe
 ar and rehearsals are disrupted by a mysterious masked figure\, they must 
 uncover the truth: is it all an elaborate prank… or is their theater tru
 ly haunted?
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/kids/goosebumps/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SIX
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T150000
UID:bat-202611151300-six@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. From Tudor Queens to Pop Icons\, the SIX wives of Henry VII
 I take the microphone to remix five hundred years of historical heartbreak
  into a Euphoric Celebration of 21st century girl power! This new original
  musical is the global sensation that everyone is losing their head over!
LOCATION:IU Auditorium
URL:https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/six-2026
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
