DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261115T213000
UID:bat-202611151930-idomeneo@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Based on a 1705 play by Crébillion père\, Mozart’s firs
 t mature opera demonstrates his mastery of orchestration\, accompanied rec
 itatives\, and lyrical beauty. While it premiered in 1781 in Munich\, it d
 id not see its U.S. premiere until 1947\, at Tanglewood.
LOCATION:IU Musical Arts Center
URL:https://operaballet.indiana.edu/events/idomeneo.html
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
