SUMMARY:Symphony No. 3\, Circus Maximus
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T213000
UID:bat-202611171930-symphony-no-3-circus-maximus@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. John Corigliano’s massive 2005 work for a large concert b
 and is known for its intensity and theatricality as it stretches the bound
 aries of the wind ensemble. A synthesis of genres\, the piece references j
 azz\, martial fanfares\, circus music\, and hunting calls\, interspersed w
 ith lyrical passages.
LOCATION:IU Musical Arts Center
URL:https://operaballet.indiana.edu/events/mainstage-in-concert-circus-max
 imus.html
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
