BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T210000
UID:bat-202612101900-annie@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Discover the magic of Annie\, the iconic Broadway musical t
 hat has captured hearts for generations! The timeless tale of Little Orpha
 n Annie follows a tenacious young girl whose unbreakable optimism leads he
 r on an unforgettable journey from a New York City orphanage to a place sh
 e can finally call home.
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Straight No Chaser
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T213000
UID:bat-202612101930-straight-no-chaser@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. The holiday season is not complete without the return of a 
 cappella sensations Straight No Chaser—born right here at Indiana Univer
 sity. The group has become synonymous with the sound of the holidays\, del
 ivering crowd-pleasing arrangements with humor\, heart\, and flawless harm
 onies.
LOCATION:IU Auditorium
URL:https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/snc-2026
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
